&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/tangled-web&quot;&gt;Tangled Web&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;em&gt;They silently sat there looking over the frozen field. Carlotta heard an owl hooting in the distant woods a few hundred meters away. Otherwise, it was very quiet.&lt;/em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Grigori Karpin.&lt;/li&gt;
