&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/chapter-4-nobody-prays-for-february&quot;&gt;Nobody Prays For February&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;// Allison heard the elevator to the surface ding, open, and then shut. She was left in a dimly-lit infirmary, alone but for the patients in the beds.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Ihp.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/lilies&quot;&gt;Lilies&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;Eighteen days later, as both Kyōko and Yuriko met over drinks, neither quite looking other in the eye, the lilies in both condominiums wilted and faded. Spring had come early, the next year, the third of March.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Amelia Wright.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
