&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/chapter-2-i-don-t-want-to-set-the-world-on-fire&quot;&gt;I Don&#039;t Want To Set The World On Fire…&lt;/a&gt; - &amp;quot;&lt;/em&gt;Drew the short straw in your absence, Carol. One of the washers at the Laundr-O-Matic tried to eat someone, we&#039;re to handle it. Toff, you&#039;re with Grey— spectral disturbance at the Wal-Mart.&lt;em&gt;&amp;quot; Written by Ihp.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
