&lt;div class=&quot;footnotes-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. 97% of subjects thusfar have mentioned these three body parts specifically.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. D-1294 hails originally from Colombo, Sri Lanka. All subjects report SCP-5217-1 speaking to them in their native tongue. Thusfar, SCP-5217-1 has demonstrated fluency in 8 languages from 6 distinct language families.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. The Foundation Records and Information Safety Administration&#039;s Bureau of Internal Investigation wishes it to be known that former Site Director Wakefield&#039;s comments are included out of the necessity for an unbiased narrative of events, and not out of support, tacit or vocal, for the thoughts expressed therein on the part of RAISA or the SCP Foundation more generally.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. As a result of his amnesticization, former Vice Director Werckman has no recollection of these events, and as such will not be available for interview for the purposes of this investigation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. There are no records of such a conference having ever been held at Site 333, which is a three-person research station in [REDACTED] specializing in the containment of anomalous tropical fish.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Former Site Director Wakefield did not issue a moratorium on SCP-5217 testing at any time before his removal from office.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Subsequent memetistic analysis conducted at Site 41 on 2023/01/03 revealed no memetic corruption in Exhibit G, and thus Exhibit G is here included in its uncensored original form.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. In the interest of fairness, it should be noted that due to RAISA quarantine protocols, neither Dr. Park nor former Site Director Wakefield had access to the testing request labeled Exhibit H at the time of this exchange.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. There is no record of former Site Director Wakefield ever making such a call, nor any evidence that he ever learned that the supposed CALPEI conference did not exist.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-133010-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. As a result of this interview, Mr. Mhlanga is no longer classified as a Person of Interest, and Foundation surveillance of his activities has been cancelled.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
