&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-248555-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Translating to &amp;quot;The Machine That Grinds Bones Very Well&amp;quot;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-248555-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. A wrestling move that involves lifting an opponent and slamming them onto their back&lt;/div&gt;
