&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;« &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/uau112020&quot;&gt;November 2020&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/uau122020&quot;&gt;December 2020&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; | &lt;a class=&quot;newpage&quot; href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/uau012021&quot;&gt;January 2021&lt;/a&gt; »&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;feature-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel left-column&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;panel-heading&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Featured SCP!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;panel-body&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5302&quot;&gt;SCP-5302&lt;/a&gt;: Sweet Bod&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;An orange neon sign above the front door of SCP-5302 reads &amp;quot;HONEY BODY KARAOKE - BAR - GRILL&amp;quot;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;panel-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Featured SCP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel right-column&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;panel-heading&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Featured Tale/Format!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;panel-body&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/do-you-like-huey-lewis-and-the-news&quot;&gt;Do you like Huey Lewis and the News?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;I told him in various simple terms that he could either figure it out or I would shoot him in the balls. He nodded and told me that wasn&#039;t necessary, he could solve it.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;panel-footer&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Featured non-SCP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
