&lt;p&gt;Hey, I&#039;m &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1607158486&quot; alt=&quot;Sirslash47&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;Sirslash47&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Often also called Sirslash or Slash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I first came into contact with the SCP-wiki a few years ago. Most likely somewhere between 2012-2014 but perhaps even sooner. I&#039;d say somewhere in 2012 but I wouldn&#039;t bet on it. After 2014 I definitely knew what the wiki was. I kind of had an on-off thing where I remembered it and forgot it again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I joined in May 2020 because I remembered that I could actually apply. I actually could have joined years sooner. But I&#039;m glad that I&#039;m here now. I see myself as a mediocre member of the wiki and user of the chat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I hope I can build towards others their experience here in general. Thank you, for checking out my author page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
